WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
[Silence, then a low pulse]

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.000
The report card is coming.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.600
Do you know your grade?

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.600
[A soft tick] Math quiz: 24 / 25. Sample grades.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:14.000
[Ticks on the beat as music builds] Every quiz, task and exam.
General average 95.0, target 95. Sample grades.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.400
Simulator: try a score before you earn it.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:18.800
Forecast: set a goal, then compare cautious, realistic and hopeful terms.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.200
Report card: every term labeled actual, estimated or projected.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.600
Gradebook: scores grouped by written work, tasks and exams.

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.800
Tasks, schedule and notes, all together.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.200
[Music rises] Math in the Simulator. The exam slider climbs from 45 / 50.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.000
[Sudden silence]

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
[Huge impact, full orchestra] 48 / 50. Math becomes 95.2. The target line at 95 lights up.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.400
You need 48 / 50 to reach 95.
Nothing is saved. Grades are estimates from the scores you enter.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.600
Android phones and tablets: download the APK from the website.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.800
Windows 10 and 11: download the installer from the website.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.000
iPhone and iPad: open the web app in Safari, then Add to Home Screen.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:49.200
Mac, Chromebook and Linux: open it in the browser. Nothing to install.

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:52.400
Every platform: sign in with Google and your workspace syncs across devices.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.600
[Music resolves] AMPlifier. Know your grade before the report card does.

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:00.000
[Final chord rings out] Free. Download now.
